Subject: [PATCH 433/443] [ae-patch] Fold a long approval message to three
 lines with Show more, and read the slot cap ask behind its policy-name prefix

A generic approval card printed the whole policy message (often 15 lines), which pushed Approve and Reject off a phone screen. A message over 200 characters or 3 lines now folds to three lines with a Show more and Show less toggle (AeClampedMessage); short messages render as before. The policy engine joins each ask reason as '<policy name>: <reason>', so the slot cap ask reached parseAeSlotsFull as 'ae_slot_cap: Slots full: ...', failed the headline match and fell back to plain text; the parser now drops that prefix.
